bp3 g - graph/node state. Doors:
bp3 g c|r|d ...              graph door (create, read, delete)
bp3 g <graph> c|r|u|d ...    node door for one graph
bp3 g <graph> n <node> r     read one node (canonical nested address)
bp3 g <graph> n <node> e <edge> [flags]   take one node's edge (canonical nested address)
bp3 g <graph> diagram ...    generated graph diagram from the live rollup (mvp.4)
bp3 g icebox r [term...]     search frozen icebox entries (read-only)
bp3 n [r]                    claimed node door: read the claimed run's node (rename.1)
bp3 e [<edge> ...]           claimed edge door: resolved context, no names typed (mvp.2)
bp3 harness desk <verb> ...  desks (machine-local); bp3 worktree is its documented alias
bp3 config [--source]        view the machine-local config store (<git-common-dir>/bp3/)
bp3 g hooks                  harness hook emitter (fail-open)
Run bp3 g <door> -h for that door's verbs, edges, and flags.
